{"id":3423,"date":"2022-07-21T10:43:26","date_gmt":"2022-07-21T10:43:26","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/?page_id=3423"},"modified":"2024-03-06T06:41:23","modified_gmt":"2024-03-06T06:41:23","slug":"campus-life","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/campus-life\/","title":{"rendered":"Campus Life"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3541 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/Institution1-300x139.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"613\" height=\"284\" srcset=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/Institution1-300x139.jpg 300w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/Institution1-1024x475.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/Institution1-768x356.jpg 768w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/Institution1-1536x712.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/Institution1.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 613px) 100vw, 613px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>The Campus is at Hormis Nagar, Mookkannoor, a rustic village on the outskirts of Angamaly Town. A vast stretch of land comprising nearly 40 acres forms the campus. Mookkannoor being the birthplace of<strong> Late K. P. Hormis<\/strong>, the great visionary and founder of <strong>Federal Bank<\/strong>, holds an emotional bondage with each and every member of the Federal family and its well-wishers. Therefore the campus is named <strong>Hormis Nagar<\/strong>. With its scenic beauty and virgin surroundings, this typical Kerala Village is expected to provide proper ambiance for the prestigious academic institution. The campus is within a radius of hardly 4 km. from NH 47, 7 km. from Angamaly Railway station and 11 km. from Kochi International Airport. Well known pilgrim centres like Kalady, the birth place of <strong>Adi Sankara<\/strong>, and Malayattoor, blessed with the footprints of <strong>St. Thomas<\/strong> and the famous Athirappily Waterfalls, one of the important tourist attractions of the state are also in the vicinity of the campus.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3538 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/college1-300x148.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"653\" height=\"322\" srcset=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/college1-300x148.jpg 300w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/college1-1024x504.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/college1-768x378.jpg 768w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/college1.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 653px) 100vw, 653px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>The educational experience at FISAT is holistic and moulds young minds into socially committed global citizens. The campus provides the finest ambience for the overall development of an Individual with state-of-the-art facilities for creative teaching, experiential learning, arts, sports, professional development, research and development. The teaching-learning methodology and innovative practices adopted in the campus makes the learning experience stress free, encouraging as well as rewarding.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3539 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/fab-1-300x137.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"672\" height=\"307\" srcset=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/fab-1-300x137.jpg 300w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/fab-1-1024x466.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/fab-1.jpg 1400w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 672px) 100vw, 672px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>The students\u00a0are presented with a number of opportunities to engage in research and development activities through its various research centers and <strong>FAB lab<\/strong>. The various active clubs and student associations are a progressive platform for students to engage in activities which enrich their knowledge and skill sets. There is a special emphasis on activities which nurture a sense of social commitment and environment in the young minds. Ample support is provided for students who look forward to becoming <strong>entrepreneurs<\/strong>.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-3540 aligncenter\" src=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/ground-1-300x137.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"668\" height=\"305\" srcset=\"https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/ground-1-300x137.jpg 300w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/ground-1-1024x467.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/ground-1-768x350.jpg 768w, https:\/\/fisat.ac.in\/wp-content\/uploads\/2022\/07\/ground-1.jpg 1500w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 668px) 100vw, 668px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Living inside the campus in FISAT hostels is an experience many cherish for a lifetime. The freedom students enjoy and camaraderie they share is awesome. The beautiful and well-maintained infrastructure for <strong>sports facilities<\/strong> are perfect for the sportive mind. Students never miss the magnificent <strong>Library<\/strong> and <strong>Central Computing Centre<\/strong> in the campus. The campus provides a nourishing environment for indulging in creative activities in literature and arts along with their highly demanding engineering and management education. The <strong>cultural<\/strong> and <strong>technical fests<\/strong> are the exciting part of life at FISAT.<\/p>\n<p><strong>Life at FISAT<\/strong> is a perfect blend of <strong>education and experience<\/strong> &#8211; a great campus to spend the best days of one&#8217;s life.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The Campus is at Hormis Nagar, Mookkannoor, a rustic village on the outskirts of Angamaly Town. A vast stretch of land comprising nearly 40 acres forms the campus. Mookkannoor being the birthplace of Late K. P